        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Understanding Your Hair Condition\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe begin with a detailed consultation to assess hair loss, donor area strength, and the best treatment approach for natural results.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTypically 30 to 45 minutes"
